      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "With Qixi Festival (Chinese Valentine's Day) falling on August 19th this year, LOEWE has unveiled a special capsule collection of bags and charms. The new Scarf handbag is bathed in a dreamy crystal pink, with knotted details on both sides symbolizing the bond of love. The adorable red bean charm nods to the classic Chinese poem that says \"this object best conveys my longing.\"",
