      "text": "The newly introduced Scarf handbag is crafted from two pieces of smooth calfskin, elegantly tied together with leather straps, reminiscent of a bundle you might casually knot with a silk scarf before heading out. The Qixi-exclusive mini version comes in a dreamy crystal pink, evoking romance and sweetness, while the knot details on both sides echo the harmony and connection of love.",
