    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "In traditional Chinese culture, the red bean symbolizes longing and steadfast love, as immortalized in Wang Wei's Tang dynasty poem \"Love Seeds\": \"This object best conveys my longing.\" For this Qixi collection, LOEWE has crafted a red bean pod from pink calfskin, adorned with brass beans that dangle delicately—a perfect little token of affection for your significant other on Qixi.",
